 BCPS Lab 9 - Spreadsheet Data Analysis

## Aim
To perform spreadsheet operations and analyse data using LibreOffice Calc.

## Software Used
LibreOffice Calc

## Procedure
1. Opened LibreOffice Calc.
2. Created a spreadsheet and entered data.
3. Applied cell formatting.
4. Used formulas and functions to perform calculations.
5. Organised and analysed the data.
6. Verified the results.
7. Saved the spreadsheet.

## Result
Practised spreadsheet operations, data organisation, and calculations using LibreOffice Calc.
